                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazoshiburira amafeza yabo mu nzira, n’amazahabu yabo azobabera nk’igihumane; amafeza n’amazahabu vyabo ntibizoshobora kubarokora ku musi w’uburake bg’Uhoraho; ntibizohāza imitima yabo, canke ngo bihāze inda zabo: kuko vyababereye igitsitaza co kubagwisha mu bigabitanyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
