        {
          "text": "Ivyago bizogerekerana n’ibindi, n’impuha zigerekerane n’izindi; bazoja kuronderera k’ūvugishwa n’Imana ko yoba har’ ico yeretswe; kukw ivyagezwe bizobura ku muherezi, n’inama zibure ku bo hambere. ",
          "type": "text",
