              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami azocura akanihiro, n’umuganwa ubujonjogore bumufate, amaboko y’abantu bo mu gihugu ahinde agashitsi: nanje nzobagirira nk’ukw ingeso zabo zimeze, mbacire urubanza rukwiranye na bo; maze bazomenya yuko jewe nd’ Uhoraho.",
          "type": "text",
